| Component | Location | Port strategy |
|-----------|----------|---------------|
| **`atomicAdd(semaphore, 1)`** | `tile_scheduler.hpp:340,661` | Direct CUDA intrinsic |
| **`__shfl_sync` / `__shfl_up_sync`** | scheduler + `warp_prefix_sum` | Direct CUDA |
| **`__ballot_sync` + `__popc`** | varlen batch lookup | Direct CUDA |
| **`named_barrier_sync/arrive`** | `named_barrier.hpp:17-44` | Raw PTX: `bar.sync`, `bar.arrive` |
| **`FastDivmod`** | CUTLASS `fast_math.h:325` | ~20 lines: precompute multiplier/shift on host; device uses `__umulhi` — easy to copy |
| **`cute::tuple` / `get<N>`** | everywhere | Replace with struct `{m,h,b,s}` |
| **`cute::ceil_div`** | prep + block.h | `(a+b-1)/b` |
| **`cutlass::find_log2`** | L2 swizzle | `31 - __clz(x)` |
| **CUB `BlockMergeSort`** | prep kernel (Sort=true) | Only if enabling batch sort; otherwise skip |
| **`cutlass::arch::launch_dependent_grids`** | PDL | Hopper-specific; optional for first port |
| **`CUTLASS_DEVICE` macros** | annotations only | `#define` to `__device__` |
| **CuTe layouts / TMA / WGMMA** | mainloop | Separate from scheduler — not needed for scheduler port |

**Scheduler shared storage:** just `int` (Dynamic) or `int4` (Varlen) in kernel smem — trivial.

**`warp_prefix_sum`** — fully portable:

```660:668:/home/yak/data-fast/agent/reference/libraries/vllm-flash-attention/hopper/utils.h
template<class T>
CUTE_DEVICE T warp_prefix_sum(T val) {
    int lane = threadIdx.x % cutlass::NumThreadsPerWarp;
    for (int i = 1; i < cutlass::NumThreadsPerWarp; i <<= 1) {
        T partial_sum = __shfl_up_sync(0xffffffff, val, i);
        if (lane >= i) { val += partial_sum; }
    }
    return val;
}
```

